// FP8 E4M3 x E4M3 -> FP32, m64nNk32, both operands from SMEM.  FP8 WGMMA is
// TN-only (no transpose immediates).  scale_d: 0 = overwrite (D = A*B),
// 1 = accumulate.  First instruction of a K-block uses scale_d=0 so the
// accumulator may hold garbage between blocks.
